Package: infiltrator-os-plymouth-theme
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Infiltrator Projects <noreply@infiltrator-projects.invalid>
Depends: plymouth
Description: Infiltrator OS Plymouth boot and shutdown theme
 Installs the canonical Infiltrator OS Plymouth splash for Debian and
 Linux Mint derived systems, selects it as the active theme and rebuilds
 initramfs.
